er/value "is convergent" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186313767}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186312569} :answer-field/id #uuid "ad8581ea-01a3-552b-b010-20dca6b54415" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186314477} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "50a6dbce-3b8b-52f2-8595-d9645ffb056b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "s>0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186312630} {:answer/id #uuid "745745b1-9e71-537f-87e1-36c6bd569e3a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "s\\ge 0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186312901} {:answer/id #uuid "9bfe4e3e-5945-575c-b27a-a759266e215e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "s\\in R" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186313209} {:answer/id #uuid "caac7a5b-c69e-5c7a-8bd3-a4bd8182f044" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "s<0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186313557}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186312630} :answer-field/id #uuid "b1457f36-2cf6-5fbb-b072-e1625eaecc92" :answer-field/key "field-6" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186314489} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1d373820-b0e7-529e-99d9-5520eb79af11" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "{\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }-\\frac{7}{3}{e}^{-st}\\,\\text{d}t" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186312194} {:answer/id #uuid "455c3d79-a766-5ba6-b1f0-fdda67686b54" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "{\\int }_{-\\infty }^{\\infty }-\\frac{7}{3}{e}^{st}\\,\\text{d}t" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186312538} {:answer/id #uuid "53fe4f18-09e9-5339-9c66-b655536d5328" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "{\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }-\\frac{7}{3}{e}^{st}\\,\\text{d}t" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186312654} {:answer/id #uuid "80f85eee-3f85-5c56-ab9f-0ba01c0b7981" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "is divergent" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186313013} {:answer/id #uuid "8e23d9ce-43e0-530a-8e9a-f5cc492e7fdd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "{\\int }_{-\\infty }^{\\infty }-\\frac{7}{3}{e}^{-st}\\,\\text{d}t" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186313108}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186313013} :answer-field/id #uuid "e97b2fa9-46ac-536c-abe2-b4088d05e39b" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186314652}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "fab44b32-fbe7-5869-a578-21cf460cb644" :question/math-academy-id "q-340719" :question/problem "Complete the arguments in the reasoning below to find the Laplace transform of $f(t)=-\\frac{7}{3}.$First, we apply the definition of the Laplace transform:\n\n$$\nL{f(t)}=F(s)={{field-1}}\n$$\n\nWe now examine the convergence of $F(s)$ for different values of $s:$\n\n$\\,$ For $s<0,$ we have that $$\n\\displaystyle {\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }-\\frac{7}{3}{e}^{-st}\\,\\text{d}t\n$$ {{field-2}}\n\n$\\,$ For $s>0,$ we have that $$\n\\displaystyle {\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }-\\frac{7}{3}{e}^{-st}\\,\\text{d}t\n$$ {{field-3}}\n\n$\\,$ For $s=0,$ we have that $$\n\\displaystyle {\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }-\\frac{7}{3}{e}^{-st}\\,\\text{d}t\n$$ {{field-4}}\n\nEvaluating our integral for $s>0,$ we have\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }-\\frac{7}{3}{e}^{-st}\\,\\text{d}t={{field-5}}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we conclude that $L{-\\frac{7}{3}}=-\\frac{7}{3s},$ \ndefined for\n{{field-6}}." :question/worked-solution "For a function $f(t)$ defined on $[0,\\infty ),$ the Laplace transform of $f,$ denoted $L{f(t)}$ or $F(s),$ is a function of the variable $s$ defined as\n\n$$\nF(s)=L{f(t)}={\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }{e}^{-st}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t\n$$\n\nprovided that this integral exists and is finite. \n\nFor the function $f(t)=-\\frac{7}{3},$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(s)={\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }-\\frac{7}{3}{e}^{-st}\\text{d}t.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe calculate our integral as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(s) & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }-\\frac{7}{3}{e}^{-st}\\text{d}t \\\\  & =-\\frac{7}{3}\\lim_{a\\to \\infty }{\\int }_{0}^{a}{e}^{-st}\\text{d}t\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo evaluate the last integral, we must consider whether $s\\ne 0$ or $s=0.$\n\n- If $s\\ne 0,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(s) & =-\\frac{7}{3}\\lim_{a\\to \\infty }{\\int }_{0}^{a}{e}^{-st}\\text{d}t \\\\  & =-\\frac{7}{3}\\lim_{a\\to \\infty }{(-\\frac{1}{s}{e}^{-st})|}_{0}^{a} \\\\  & =\\frac{7}{3s}(\\lim_{a\\to \\infty }{e}^{-sa}-1).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLet's evaluate the limit. We have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\lim_{a\\to \\mathrm{\\infty }}{e}^{-sa}=\\begin{cases}0,\\hspace{1em} & s>0, \\\\ \\mathrm{\\infty },\\hspace{1em} & s<0.\\end{cases}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- If $s=0,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(0) & =-\\frac{7}{3}\\lim_{a\\to \\infty }{\\int }_{0}^{a}{e}^{-0t}\\text{d}t \\\\  & =-\\frac{7}{3}\\lim_{a\\to \\infty }{\\int }_{0}^{a}\\text{d}t \\\\  & =-\\frac{7}{3}\\lim_{a\\to \\infty }t\\,{|}_{0}^{a} \\\\  & =-\\frac{7}{3}\\lim_{a\\to \\infty }(a-0) \\\\  & =-\\frac{7}{3}\\lim_{a\\to \\infty }a \\\\  & =-\\infty .\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore:\n\n- For $s<0,$ we have that $$\n\\displaystyle {\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }-\\frac{7}{3}{e}^{-st}\\text{d}t\\,\\text{is divergent}\n$$\n\n- For $s>0,$ we have that $$\n\\displaystyle {\\int }_{{}_{0}}^{\\infty }-\\frac{7}{3}{e}^{-st}\\text{d}t\\,\\text{is convergent}\n$$\n\n- For $s=0,$ we have that $$\n\\displaystyle {\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }-\\frac{7}{3}{e}^{-st}\\text{d}t\\,\\text{is divergent}\n$$\n\nEvaluating our integral for $s>0,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(s) & =\\frac{7}{3s}(\\lim_{a\\to \\infty }{e}^{-sa}-1) \\\\  & =\\frac{7}{3s}(0-1) \\\\  & =-\\frac{7}{3s}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the Laplace transform of $f(t)=-\\frac{7}{3}$ is $F(s)=-\\frac{7}{3s},$ defined for $s>0.$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186315002 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "06a7fe57-b9b6-5ba7-b671-4f7088c38502" :answer/type {: