id #edb/ref 17592186313385} {:answer/id #uuid "cbb6cba1-24ff-51d7-b5f4-c961117601c9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{7}{s-7}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186313565} {:answer/id #uuid "d7f7c6a3-ab84-52f4-8b4e-2cf23dde528f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{7-s}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186313676}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186312241} :answer-field/id #uuid "67b2bbf8-38aa-59b1-8cd2-2faf3fc72276" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186314302} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "25e006dc-6d4a-5484-b023-4f492dee6b90" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "s>7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186312261} {:answer/id #uuid "ebaa7519-170f-5af1-9118-c293f3fbf69c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "s\\le 7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186313856}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186312261} :answer-field/id #uuid "84bd00b2-4aa2-5bf6-a5c4-0a3a4f2bb1ef" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186314359} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0518a67d-99b6-5651-8176-5d64ef951689" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "{\\int }_{-\\infty }^{\\infty }{e}^{(7+s)t}\\,\\text{d}t" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186312007} {:answer/id #uuid "0e6e7e6b-1de0-52b4-ab30-4f1f5508b5d8" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "{\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }{e}^{(7+s)t}\\,\\text{d}t" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186312079} {:answer/id #uuid "3117ba57-f297-5193-b0e6-146072f5a71b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "{\\int }_{-\\infty }^{\\infty }{e}^{(7-s)t}\\,\\text{d}t" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186312373} {:answer/id #uuid "dad88878-715b-5d80-81b8-8bdb7c9f39a0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "s\\le 7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186313695} {:answer/id #uuid "f10af5f3-c797-5a3b-88fc-e48bb5b10342" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "{\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }{e}^{(7-s)t}\\,\\text{d}t" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186313905}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186313695} :answer-field/id #uuid "ee92d555-a2e0-514c-9e04-28b2f42ed271" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186314662}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "c3f7443a-9ebb-599a-b0d1-1f759dc0db07" :question/math-academy-id "q-340724" :question/problem "Complete the arguments in the reasoning below to find the Laplace transform of $f(t)={e}^{7t}.$First, we apply the definition of the Laplace transform:\n\n$$\nL{f(t)}=F(s)={{field-1}}\n$$\n\nWe now examine the convergence of $F(s)$ for different values of $s:$\n\n$\\,$ For {{field-2}}\nthe integral is divergent.\n\n$\\,$ For {{field-3}}\nthe integral is convergent.\n\nEvaluating our integral in the convergent case, we have\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }{e}^{(7-s)t}\\,\\text{d}t={{field-4}}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we conclude that $L{{e}^{7t}}=\\frac{1}{s-7},$ \ndefined for\n{{field-5}}." :question/worked-solution "For a function $f(t)$ defined on $[0,\\infty ),$ the Laplace transform of $f,$ denoted $L{f(t)}$ or $F(s),$ is a function of the variable $s$ defined as\n\n$$\nF(s)=L{f(t)}={\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }{e}^{-st}f(t)\\,\\text{d}t\n$$\n\nprovided that this integral exists and is finite. \n\nFor the function $f(t)={e}^{7t},$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(s) & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }{e}^{-st}\\cdot {e}^{7t}\\text{d}t \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }{e}^{-st+7t}\\text{d}t \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }{e}^{(7-s)t}\\text{d}t.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe calculate our integral as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(s) & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\infty }{e}^{(7-s)t}\\text{d}t \\\\  & =\\lim_{a\\to \\infty }{\\int }_{0}^{a}{e}^{(7-s)t}\\text{d}t\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo evaluate the last integral, we must consider whether $s\\ne 7$ or $s=7.$\n\n- If $s\\ne 7,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(s) & =\\lim_{a\\to \\infty }{\\int }_{0}^{a}{e}^{(7-s)t}\\text{d}t \\\\  & =\\lim_{a\\to \\infty }{(\\frac{1}{7-s}{e}^{(7-s)t})|}_{0}^{a} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{7-s}(\\lim_{a\\to \\infty }{e}^{(7-s)a}-1) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{s-7}(1-\\lim_{a\\to \\infty }{e}^{(7-s)a}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{s-7}-\\frac{1}{s-7}\\cdot {lim}_{a\\to \\infty }{e}^{(7-s)a}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLet's evaluate the limit. We have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\lim_{a\\to \\mathrm{\\infty }}{e}^{(7-s)a}=\\begin{cases}0,\\hspace{1em} & s>7, \\\\ \\mathrm{\\infty },\\hspace{1em} & s<7.\\end{cases}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- If $s=7,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(7) & =\\lim_{a\\to \\infty }{\\int }_{0}^{a}{e}^{(7-7)t}\\text{d}t \\\\  & =\\lim_{a\\to \\infty }{\\int }_{0}^{a}{e}^{0t}\\text{d}t \\\\  & =\\lim_{a\\to \\infty }{\\int }_{0}^{a}\\text{d}t \\\\  & =\\lim_{a\\to \\infty }t\\,{|}_{0}^{a} \\\\  & =\\lim_{a\\to \\infty }(a-0) \\\\  & =\\lim_{a\\to \\infty }a \\\\  & =\\infty .\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore:\n\n- For $s\\le 7$ the integral is divergent.\n\n- For $s>7$ the integral is convergent.\n\nEvaluating for $s>7,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}F(s) & =\\frac{1}{s-7}-\\frac{1}{s-7}\\cdot {lim}_{a\\to \\infty }{e}^{(7-s)a} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{s-7}-\\frac{1}{s-7}\\cdot 0 \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{s-7}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the Laplace transform of $f(t)={e}^{7t}$ is $F(s)=\\frac{1}{s-7},$ defined for $s>7.$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186315003 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "15af4390-ea8f-5766-a121-0ad68670fb25" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "s\\ge -1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186312126} {:answer/id #uuid "20b8e3e0-7612-5d0f-88f4-3828eca0e299" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "s\\ge 0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186312225} {:answer/id #uuid "31766177-d6df-5efc-9be1-7b69cb65b1d9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "s>0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186312376