"\\frac{n}{L\\pi }x" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186316503}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186316454} :answer-field/id #uuid "4556c291-ff74-5df7-a137-ac94acc780a5" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186316703} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1a84d9d0-34f1-5070-ab3a-7f7e403badd2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{\\pi }{\\int }_{-\\pi }^{\\pi }f(x)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{2\\pi }{L}x)\\,\\text{d}x" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186315273} {:answer/id #uuid "2d2d45f1-47c9-5d69-9fc5-5f9056932802" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{L}{\\int }_{-L}^{L}f(x)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{2\\pi }{L}x)\\,\\text{d}x" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186315381} {:answer/id #uuid "52f0d164-9fa6-5d18-bff3-6e9d4751f959" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{L}{\\int }_{-L}^{L}f(x)\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{2\\pi }{L}x)\\,\\text{d}x" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186315593} {:answer/id #uuid "7f086ea4-301a-5951-9b24-f053bd0e4029" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{\\pi }{\\int }_{-\\pi }^{\\pi }f(x)\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{2L}{\\pi }x)\\,\\text{d}x" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186315817} {:answer/id #uuid "89b2672a-2a47-50ac-82ad-5abcd1bea380" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{\\pi }{\\int }_{-\\pi }^{\\pi }f(x)\\,\\text{d}x" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186315885} {:answer/id #uuid "d5852c11-7682-5ad4-813c-4c6da2f5e302" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{L}{\\int }_{-L}^{L}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186316312}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186315593} :answer-field/id #uuid "5a394c62-ee80-54db-badf-74ae206c67d2" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186316758} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3ea15690-bd3a-52f1-86f6-4c412c61a17c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{3\\pi }" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186315479} {:answer/id #uuid "4430eea9-0a65-5c2f-a9de-1820fbc6df9f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{3}{\\pi }" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186315516} {:answer/id #uuid "7c14563a-04ff-596b-b867-bfeee109fb9c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{\\pi }" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186315805} {:answer/id #uuid "be458129-66c4-5eb7-a99c-7e9c1e1b46b7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186316191}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186316191} :answer-field/id #uuid "84cd0fb9-ecb4-5319-8f4f-d7276fdcceae" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186316856} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4540991b-563f-5e76-817c-93de36b4a02c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{n}{L\\pi }x" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186315520} {:answer/id #uuid "4a6630c4-7aac-5235-bca1-d786916183fd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{nL}{\\pi }x" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186315545} {:answer/id #uuid "7103c9e0-86e9-5b41-8281-6f63247863a2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{L}{n\\pi }x" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186315757} {:answer/id #uuid "858e9716-2132-5f6c-8133-079db0878d8e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{n\\pi }{L}x" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186315861}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186315861} :answer-field/id #uuid "941858c3-5b75-5920-a684-41e8a48fd64b" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186316887}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "db7b5b6b-a8e8-59b9-8c99-30fda8d90168" :question/math-academy-id "q-341776" :question/problem "Let $f(x)$ be the $2L$-periodic extension of a function $F(x)$ from $x\\in [-L,L)$ to $x\\in R.$\nSelect the correct options in the reasoning below.The Fourier series of $f$ is given by\n\n$$\nf(x)∼\\frac{{a}_{0}}{2}+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}\\operatorname{cos}⁡({{field-1}})+{b}_{n}\\operatorname{sin}⁡({{field-2}}).\n$$\n\nThe $2$nd cosine coefficient of the series is\n\n$$\n{a}_{2}={{field-3}}.\n$$\n\nGiven that $F(x)=\\operatorname{ln}⁡({x}^{2}+1)$ and $L=3,$ the $2$nd cosine coefficient becomes\n\n$$\n{a}_{2}={{field-4}}\\,\\cdot \\,{{field-5}}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Recall that multiplying the argument of a function by $k\\ne 0$ represents the horizontal stretching of the corresponding graph by a factor of $\\frac{1}{k}.$\n\nNow, let $s=\\frac{\\pi }{L}x.$ Then, since $f(x)$ has a period of $2L,$ the function\n\n$$\ng(s)=f(\\frac{L}{\\pi }s)\n$$\n\nmust have a period of $2L\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{L}=2\\pi .$ \n\nThe Fourier series of $g(s)$ is\n\n$$\ng(s)∼\\frac{{a}_{0}}{2}+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(ns)+{b}_{n}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(ns),\n$$\n\nwhere:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{a}_{0} & =\\frac{1}{\\pi }{\\int }_{-\\pi }^{\\pi }g(s)\\,\\text{d}s \\\\ {a}_{n} & =\\frac{1}{\\pi }{\\int }_{-\\pi }^{\\pi }g(s)\\operatorname{cos}⁡(ns)\\,\\text{d}s,\\,n\\ge 1 \\\\ {b}_{n} & =\\frac{1}{\\pi }{\\int }_{-\\pi }^{\\pi }g(s)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(ns)\\,\\text{d}s,\\,n\\ge 1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting $s=\\frac{\\pi }{L}x$ and using the fact that $g(s)=f(\\frac{L}{\\pi }s),$ we get the Fourier series of $f(x):$\n\n$$\nf(x)∼\\frac{{a}_{0}}{2}+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi }{L}x)+{b}_{n}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi }{L}x)\n$$\n\nTherefore, $2$nd cosine coefficient of $f(x)$ is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{a}_{2} & =\\frac{1}{\\pi }{\\int }_{-\\pi }^{\\pi }g(s)\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2s)\\,\\text{d}s \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\pi }{\\int }_{-\\pi }^{\\pi }f(\\frac{L}{\\pi }s)\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2s)\\,\\text{d}s \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\pi }{\\int }_{-L}^{L}f(\\frac{L}{\\pi }\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{L}x)\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{L}x)\\,\\text{d}(\\frac{\\pi }{L}x) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\pi }\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{L}{\\int }_{-L}^{L}f(x)\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{2\\pi }{L}x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{L}{\\int }_{-L}^{L}f(x)\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{2\\pi }{L}x)\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, substituting $L=3$ and $f(x)=F(x)=\\operatorname{ln}⁡({x}^{2}+1),$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{a}_{2} & =\\frac{1}{3}\\cdot {\\int }_{-3}^{3}\\operatorname{ln}⁡({x}^{2}+1)\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{2\\pi }{3}x)\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186317177 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "006d79e5-194b-5928-a454-a9e6ef2988ee" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{n}{L\\pi }x" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186315115} {:answer/id #uuid "1314d92f-7a6f-52f1-8ab9-c271ffe34549" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{nL}{\\pi }x" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186315231} {:answer/id #uuid "308f3d61-b88b-5b27-8c4f-417c73e5b627" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{L}{n\\pi }x" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186315393} {:answer/id #uuid "85cdf91d-2106-57b6-b9c7-4a9b68a5eb78" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{n\\pi }{L}x" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186315863}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186315863} :answer-field/id #uuid "399d87a4-fab1-5e46-88ed-2ba8f0dcbcb2" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186316682} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6ce812b4-7454-5a97-9c20-db71b47000d7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{4\\pi }" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186315733} {:answer/id #uuid "81494f0e-593e-5b1c-bba9-41932d06deae" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{4}{\\pi }" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186315830} {:answer/id #uuid "987b7429-fcd4-5